# Contact form delivery.
#
# Get a free access key at https://web3forms.com — enter the destination inbox
# (debanganghoshcse@gmail.com) and the key is emailed straight back; no account
# is required. The key is public by design: it names the destination, it does
# not grant access to anything, so it is safe in the client bundle.
#
# Copy this file to `.env`, paste the key in, and restart the dev server.
# On Vercel/Netlify, add the same variable in the project's env settings.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
